# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit a real .env file or hardcode API keys in source files.
#
# Quickstart (Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key
# 5. Copy this file to .env and paste your key below
#
# Production Setup:
# - Provision a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API
# - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer / IP and designated APIs:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
